                <pb facs="0738" n="668" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg668"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>Mr. Romero to Mr.
                        Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-08-30"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >August</hi> 30, 1867</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Mr. Romero’s compliments to Mr. Seward, and has the honor to send him the copy of
                    a letter, dated in Mexico, the 9th instant, containing important news from that
                    republic, which was published in the New York Herald of this date.</p>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d419-a1.xml" xpointer="d419-a1"/>
